hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"77","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Koi ummat kabhi halak nahin hui magar shirk ki wajah se. Aur us ke shirk ki ibtida taqdeer ke jhutlane ke siwa kuch na thi.'"
